      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "私の寝室は小さいですが、私はそれがとても好きです。",
      "text_en": "My bedroom is small, but I like it very much.",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"わたし\" data-defn=\"I/me\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">私</span><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"の\" data-defn=\"possessive particle (&#x27;s / of)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">の</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"しんしつ\" data-defn=\"bedroom\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">寝室</span><rt>しんしつ</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ちーさい\" data-defn=\"small/little/tiny; slight/below average (in degree, amount, etc.)/minor/small\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">小さい</span><rt>ちーさい</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"です\" data-defn=\"be / is / are (polite copula)\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">です</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby>、<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"わたし\" data-defn=\"I/me\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">私</span><rt>わたし</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"は\" data-defn=\"topic marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">は</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"それ\" data-defn=\"that/it; then/that point (in time)/that time\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">それ</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"が\" data-defn=\"subject marker\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">が</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"とても\" data-defn=\"very/awfully/exceedingly; (not) at all/by no means/simply (cannot)\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">とても</span><rt></rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"すき\" data-defn=\"liked/well-liked/favourite/favorite; in love (with)/loved/romantically interested (in\" data-hsk=\"JLPT N5\"><span class=\"si\">好き</span><rt>すき</rt></ruby><rub